      <h1>Wash Plant vs <em>Trommel</em>: Which Is Better?</h1>
      <p>Understand the key differences between gold wash plants and trommels. Compare throughput, recovery rates, costs, and applications to choose the right equipment for your operation.</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-top:16px">Published March 10, 2026 · Gold Wash Plants</p>
